{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113207","id":3668914739,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7arzIz","number":113207,"title":"Modifying the RTL VScrollBar step causes scrolling to stop working w/ large font sizes","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-26T20:13:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T12:44:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.1 and 4.6 dev4\n\n### System information\n\nAny\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging the scroll step works on small font sizes, but breaks with large ones.\n```GDScript\nvar v_scroll_bar := rich_text_label.get_v_scroll_bar()\nv_scroll_bar.step = rich_text_label.get_line_height(0)\n```\n\nThis will correctly scroll full lines (assuming even line height throughout) using the default font size, but will break when the font size exceeds 27-30. It will still work if you hover over the scroll bar when scrolling, but won't when hovering over the RTL as a whole.\n\nAccounting for uneven sizes between the label `size.y` and the scroll bar's `step`/`max_value` doesn't have any effect.\n\nSetting the Focus mode to All and scrolling with the arrow keys works fine.\n\nThe RTL registers inputs as usual, it simply seems not to pass the scroll events to the VScrollBar\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rtl-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23779304/rtl-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113207/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}